DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260919
DTSTAMP:20260918T143827Z
UID:84638370a78e23b0bcaa6c96791e@visitri-calendar
DESCRIPTION:RI Comedy Hall of Famers Charlie Hall and Doreen Collins have 
 created a new hit show called AGING DISGRACEFULLY. It’s a mix of stand-u
 p\, song\, and skits\, on the perks of trying to stay young and the pitfal
 ls of getting old. From botox to bifocals to bingo\, this dynamic duo cove
 rs it all in jokes and musical parodies.\n\nSource: https://www.visitrhode
 island.com/event/aging-disgracefully-%26%238211%3b-fall-aging/111563/
LOCATION:Courthouse Center for the Arts\, 3481 Kingstown Rd\, West Kingsto
 n\, RI 02892
URL:https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/aging-disgracefully-%26%238211%
 3b-fall-aging/111563/
END:VEVENT
